13
00:00:39,233 --> 00:00:41,718
Le rezaron a Bochica, el viejo sabio.

14
00:00:41,768 --> 00:00:44,253
Le dejaron tejidos y semillas, y noches

15
00:00:44,303 --> 00:00:46,063
